      <activity id="668ec499-2bfc-516d-9904-6316974c0d99" activityNameId="ece90f5e-aa62-5743-b795-e3b538ce9256" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Takeback and recycling, c-Si PV module</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Takeback and recycling, c-Si PV module
This dataset represents a weighted average of the recycling efforts of four recycling facilities in Europe. The average transport distance of waste c-Si PV panels is assumed to be 500 km.;
UUID: c2109eeb-18ba-4ffa-8a77-d4ece0eb316e
This dataset includes the transport of used crystalline silicon photovoltaic modules to the recycling facility as well as their dismantling and recycling. The consumption of energy and the disposal of plastic components are also included. The takeback and recycling of the electric installation and the mounting structure are not included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at recycling companies in Europe. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c2109eeb-18ba-4ffa-8a77-d4ece0eb316e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
